### SERVICE 1 - Addition de deux matrices
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2], [3, 4]],
  "B": [[5, 6], [7, 8]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Addition avec dimensions incompatibles
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/add
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2]],
  "B": [[5, 6], [7, 8]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Multiplication de deux matrices 2x2
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/multiply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2], [3, 4]],
  "B": [[5, 6], [7, 8]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Multiplication de matrices 3x3
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/multiply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7, 8, 9]],
  "B": [[9, 8, 7], [6, 5, 4], [3, 2, 1]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Multiplication avec dimensions valides 2x3 * 3x2
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/multiply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]],
  "B": [[7, 8], [9, 10], [11, 12]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Multiplication avec dimensions incompatibles
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/multiply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2], [3, 4]],
  "B": [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6], [7, 8, 9]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Transposée d'une matrice 2x3
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/transpose
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Transposée d'une matrice carrée
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/transpose
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2], [3, 4]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Déterminant d'une matrice 2x2
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/determinant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2], [3, 4]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Déterminant d'une matrice 3x3
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/determinant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[6, 1, 1], [4, -2, 5], [2, 8, 7]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Déterminant avec matrice non carrée
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/determinant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Inverse d'une matrice 2x2
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/inverse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2], [3, 4]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Inverse d'une matrice 3x3
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/inverse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2, 3], [0, 1, 4], [5, 6, 0]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Inverse d'une matrice singulière
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/inverse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2], [2, 4]]
}


### SERVICE 1 - Inverse avec matrice non carrée
POST http://localhost:5001/matrices/inverse
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "A": [[1, 2, 3], [4, 5, 6]]
}